🇺🇸🇺🇦🇷🇺 US-directed Ukrainian drone strikes on Russian Yandex data center have wider implications...

▪️The US has made no secret its desire to dominate the future by dominating key technology shaping it - especially artificial intelligence (AI);

▪️Eric Schmidt of Google, currently enabling Ukrainian drone strikes on Russia, had publicly discussed "China" striking US data centers to prevent a game-changing breakthrough - however it was projection meaning the US proposing striking data centers in other nations (especially China but also Russia);

▪️Through the vast network of proxies the US maintains worldwide & the failure of multipolarism to defend against or rollback US political capture, the US can freely strike at data centers/, slowing AI development while advancing AI at home free of threat;

▪️The US will continue expanding strikes on Russian data centers & continue preparing to likewise destroy Chinese centers by proxy unless serious changes are made in detering/defending against such threats;
